{"id":"ef45fe4bdcb94272","group":"92","path":"92/92-df-universal-reflection.md","title":"Universal Reflection Principle","display":"df-universal-reflection — Universal Reflection Principle","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Gödel's Incompleteness Theorems","book_abbrev":"92","label":"92-df-universal-reflection","aliases":["92-df-universal-reflection"],"display":"df-universal-reflection — Universal Reflection Principle","depends_on":["[[92-df-provability-predicate]]","[[92-df-formula]]","[[92-df-free-variable-function]]","[[92-df-signature]]","[[92-thm-substitution-representable]]"],"source":"本地反射与相容性进展扩展；对照原书第 IX 章 pp.106–110 的 HBL/Löb 背景；该 PDF 不定义这些完整模式或 Turing 进展","source_status":"原书之外的证明论扩展"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Gödel's Incompleteness Theorems"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"92"},{"key":"label","html":"92-df-universal-reflection"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>92-df-universal-reflection</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-universal-reflection — Universal Reflection Principle"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"e9cc91aaee998c7b\" href=\"?note=e9cc91aaee998c7b\" title=\"92-df-provability-predicate\">92-df-provability-predicate</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"5a1bd470754681a7\" href=\"?note=5a1bd470754681a7\" title=\"92-df-formula\">92-df-formula</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"b9e3d57e94ce36b7\" href=\"?note=b9e3d57e94ce36b7\" title=\"92-df-free-variable-function\">92-df-free-variable-function</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"d666a3e3ee6c8148\" href=\"?note=d666a3e3ee6c8148\" title=\"92-df-signature\">92-df-signature</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"04751f66804591ae\" href=\"?note=04751f66804591ae\" title=\"92-thm-substitution-representable\">92-thm-substitution-representable</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source","html":"本地反射与相容性进展扩展；对照原书第 IX 章 pp.106–110 的 HBL/Löb 背景；该 PDF 不定义这些完整模式或 Turing 进展"},{"key":"source_status","html":"原书之外的证明论扩展"}],"html":"<h1 id=\"df-universal-reflection-—-Universal-Reflection-Principle-$URF_T$\">df-universal-reflection — Universal Reflection Principle <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"URF_T\">\\(URF_T\\)</span></h1>\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Fml}_G\">\\(\\mathrm{Fml}_G\\)</span> (formula set, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"5a1bd470754681a7\" href=\"?note=5a1bd470754681a7\" title=\"92-df-formula\">92-df-formula</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{FV}_G\">\\(\\mathrm{FV}_G\\)</span> (free-variable function, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"b9e3d57e94ce36b7\" href=\"?note=b9e3d57e94ce36b7\" title=\"92-df-free-variable-function\">92-df-free-variable-function</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Prov}_G:\\mathrm{Term}_G\\to\\mathrm{Fml}_G\">\\(\\mathrm{Prov}_G:\\mathrm{Term}_G\\to\\mathrm{Fml}_G\\)</span> (internal provability-formula constructor, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"e9cc91aaee998c7b\" href=\"?note=e9cc91aaee998c7b\" title=\"92-df-provability-predicate\">92-df-provability-predicate</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"v_0,v_1\\in\\mathrm{Var}_G\">\\(v_0,v_1\\in\\mathrm{Var}_G\\)</span> (distinguished variables)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\dot{\\mathrm{SubCode}}_{G,\\varphi}\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_G\">\\(\\dot{\\mathrm{SubCode}}_{G,\\varphi}\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_G\\)</span> with <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{FV}_G(\\dot{\\mathrm{SubCode}}_{G,\\varphi})\\subseteq\\{v_0,v_1\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{FV}_G(\\dot{\\mathrm{SubCode}}_{G,\\varphi})\\subseteq\\{v_0,v_1\\}\\)</span> (a fixed internal formula strongly representing that <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"v_1\">\\(v_1\\)</span> codes the result of substituting the numeral for <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"v_0\">\\(v_0\\)</span> into <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi\">\\(\\varphi\\)</span>; its choice uses <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"04751f66804591ae\" href=\"?note=04751f66804591ae\" title=\"92-thm-substitution-representable\">92-thm-substitution-representable</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{URFN}_G\">\\(\\mathrm{URFN}_G\\)</span> (definition-target uniform-reflection schema)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}universal\\text{-}reflection}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{URFN}_G\\coloneqq\n\\left\\{\n\\forall v_0\\forall v_1\\Bigl(\n\\dot{\\mathrm{SubCode}}_{G,\\varphi}\n\\to\\bigl(\\mathrm{Prov}_G(v_1)\\to\\varphi\\bigr)\n\\Bigr)\n\\;\\middle|\\;\n\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_G\\land\\mathrm{FV}_G(\\varphi)\\subseteq\\{v_0\\}\n\\right\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}universal\\text{-}reflection}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{URFN}_G\\coloneqq\n\\left\\{\n\\forall v_0\\forall v_1\\Bigl(\n\\dot{\\mathrm{SubCode}}_{G,\\varphi}\n\\to\\bigl(\\mathrm{Prov}_G(v_1)\\to\\varphi\\bigr)\n\\Bigr)\n\\;\\middle|\\;\n\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_G\\land\\mathrm{FV}_G(\\varphi)\\subseteq\\{v_0\\}\n\\right\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>关键符号：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{URFN}_G\">\\(\\mathrm{URFN}_G\\)</span>是统一反射模式：每个至多含一个自由变量的<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi(v_0)\">\\(\\varphi(v_0)\\)</span>给出一个闭句</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\dot{\\mathrm{SubCode}}_{G,\\varphi}\">\\(\\dot{\\mathrm{SubCode}}_{G,\\varphi}\\)</span>是已经以<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"v_0,v_1\">\\(v_0,v_1\\)</span>为指定自由变量的对象语言公式，所以在模式实例中直接出现；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi\">\\(\\varphi\\)</span>也直接出现，而不把公式误写成函数应用<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi(v_0)\">\\(\\varphi(v_0)\\)</span></li>\n<li>它表示“<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"v_1\">\\(v_1\\)</span>是把<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"v_0\">\\(v_0\\)</span>的numeral代入<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi\">\\(\\varphi\\)</span>所得句子的编码”；外部代入函数本身不是<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G\">\\(G\\)</span>的函数项</li>\n<li>统一反射、局部反射和外部全局反射是不同层次的原则，不能仅凭记号互换</li>\n<li>该模式的精确强度依赖<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G\">\\(G\\)</span>、所允许公式类以及背景理论，不能无条件等同于<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\omega\">\\(\\omega\\)</span>一致性</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"df-universal-reflection-—-Universal-Reflection-Principle-$URF_T$","text":"df-universal-reflection — Universal Reflection Principle $URF_T$","level":1},{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"92-df-provability-predicate","status":"resolved","id":"e9cc91aaee998c7b","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-provability-predicate]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-formula","status":"resolved","id":"5a1bd470754681a7","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-formula]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-free-variable-function","status":"resolved","id":"b9e3d57e94ce36b7","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-free-variable-function]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-signature","status":"resolved","id":"d666a3e3ee6c8148","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-signature]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-thm-substitution-representable","status":"resolved","id":"04751f66804591ae","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-thm-substitution-representable]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-formula","status":"resolved","id":"5a1bd470754681a7","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Fml}_G$ (formula set, see [[92-df-formula]])","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-free-variable-function","status":"resolved","id":"b9e3d57e94ce36b7","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{FV}_G$ (free-variable function, see [[92-df-free-variable-function]])","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-provability-predicate","status":"resolved","id":"e9cc91aaee998c7b","anchor":"ref-8","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Prov}_G:\\mathrm{Term}_G\\to\\mathrm{Fml}_G$ (internal provability-formula constructor, see [[92-df-provability-predicate]])","embed":false},{"target":"92-thm-substitution-representable","status":"resolved","id":"04751f66804591ae","anchor":"ref-9","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\dot{\\mathrm{SubCode}}_{G,\\varphi}\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_G$ with $\\mathrm{FV}_G(\\dot{\\mathrm{SubCode}}_{G,\\varphi})\\subseteq\\{v_0,v_1\\}$ (a fixed internal formula strongly representing that $v_1$ codes the result of substituting the numeral for $v_0$ into $\\varphi$; its choice uses [[92-thm-substitution-representable]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"URF_T","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Fml}_G","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{FV}_G","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Prov}_G:\\mathrm{Term}_G\\to\\mathrm{Fml}_G","display":false},{"tex":"v_0,v_1\\in\\mathrm{Var}_G","display":false},{"tex":"\\dot{\\mathrm{SubCode}}_{G,\\varphi}\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_G","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{FV}_G(\\dot{\\mathrm{SubCode}}_{G,\\varphi})\\subseteq\\{v_0,v_1\\}","display":false},{"tex":"v_1","display":false},{"tex":"v_0","display":false},{"tex":"\\varphi","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{URFN}_G","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}universal\\text{-}reflection}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{URFN}_G\\coloneqq\n\\left\\{\n\\forall v_0\\forall v_1\\Bigl(\n\\dot{\\mathrm{SubCode}}_{G,\\varphi}\n\\to\\bigl(\\mathrm{Prov}_G(v_1)\\to\\varphi\\bigr)\n\\Bigr)\n\\;\\middle|\\;\n\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_G\\land\\mathrm{FV}_G(\\varphi)\\subseteq\\{v_0\\}\n\\right\\}","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{URFN}_G","display":false},{"tex":"\\varphi(v_0)","display":false},{"tex":"\\dot{\\mathrm{SubCode}}_{G,\\varphi}","display":false},{"tex":"v_0,v_1","display":false},{"tex":"\\varphi","display":false},{"tex":"\\varphi(v_0)","display":false},{"tex":"v_1","display":false},{"tex":"v_0","display":false},{"tex":"\\varphi","display":false},{"tex":"G","display":false},{"tex":"G","display":false},{"tex":"\\omega","display":false}],"bytes":2422,"backlinks":[{"id":"1ea2ee34667cb5dd","anchor":"ref-12","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"统一反射模式与外部全局反射分别见[[92-df-universal-reflection]]和[[92-df-global-reflection]]"},{"id":"911d25a82b6a7593","anchor":"ref-53","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[92-df-universal-reflection]]"},{"id":"823a52c75bbad9bd","anchor":"ref-211","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[92-df-universal-reflection]]"}],"outgoing":["e9cc91aaee998c7b","5a1bd470754681a7","b9e3d57e94ce36b7","d666a3e3ee6c8148","04751f66804591ae"]}